==English==
===Etymology===
A term coined by Sir Thomas More, from {{AGr.}} '''{{polytonic|[[οὐ]]}}''' (ou) "not, no" + '''{{polytonic|[[τόπος]]}}''' (topos) "place".

===Adjective===
'''utopian'''
# [[ideal]] but often [[impractical]]; [[visionary]]
